00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:08.780
Another day, another round of AI developments.

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:10.580
Let's break it down.

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:13.680
Open AI just made real-time voice agents

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:17.100
available to every chat GPT Plus and Pro user,

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:19.440
with free rollout starting now.

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:23.900
GPT Live rolled out today to all paid chat GPT tiers

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:26.080
on iOS, Android, and Web.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.740
Free users will gain access over the next few days.

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:33.340
The model requires an app update to reach the voice button,

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:36.160
and it will reach the API soon after.

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:39.980
Sam Altman called the experience magical and real,

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:42.540
